usage: find3 [-h] [--version] [--limit LIMIT] [--timeout TIMEOUT]
             [--doc-version VERSION] [--and | --or]
             query [query ...]

One query across our blocks, official docs and code.

positional arguments:
  query                 free-text query (`license <name>` for licensing)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             print the tools version and exit
  --limit, -n LIMIT     ranked results per source (default 5)
  --timeout TIMEOUT     timeout budget per source in seconds, shared by all
                        its backend calls (default 60)
  --doc-version VERSION
                        niagara-help documentation version for the docs source
                        (default: niagara-help's own)
  --and                 every term (blocks, docs)
  --or                  any term (blocks, docs)
